            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed in the present invention are an edaravone pharmaceutical composition and an application thereof as a sublingual preparation, the pharmaceutical composition containing edaravone or a salt thereof and mannitol. A sublingual administration preparation can avoid the first-pass effect of the liver, and samples feature good stability, convenience of transport and of use, among other advantages.</p>
            </abstract>
